<title>USA: Benchmark Electronics sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Benchmark Electronics sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ANGLETON, Texas 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benchmark Electronics Inc said on Monday that its board of directors has declared a 2-for-1 stock split.</p>
<p>The new stock resulting from the 2-for-1 split will be issued on or about August 15, 1997 to holders of record as of August 7, 1997, Benchmark said in a statement.</p>
<p>On July 28, 1997, the company had 5,753,384 shares of common stock outstanding. After the stock split, the Benchmark will have approximately 11,506,768 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
